        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In the stuffy summer heat, a girl sits at her desk, one hand sorting through a thick stack of reference materials while the other wipes sweat from her forehead."
    },
    {
        "text": "She hears footsteps behind her but doesn't bother to turn around."
    },
    {
        "text": "There are almonds on the desk, but he already knows."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.1,
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#2$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-20",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you still reading, my dear sister?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's such a fine and sunny afternoon, my dear sister! Let's go play outside!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't plan to sit with your nose in those dusty papyrus scrolls your entire life do you, my dear sister?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I talked to Father, my dear sister. He said he would consider making me the Historian of Shar-Agade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Being a padishah isn't so bad, my dear sister. So just give up already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#9$2",
        "posfrom": "0,-20",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.3,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough! Stop bothering me, you little pest!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_bookdrop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She quickly turns her head, but there is nobody behind her..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only the scroll she tossed at her brother, sprawled out on the floor."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#5$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_knockdoorfast",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you there, Pepe? Quick, let me in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm here, come in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been sending you messages on the communicator. Why didn't you respond?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I turned it off. I've been looking at books and scrolls all night. What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A <i>lot</i> happened last night. Did you seriously not hear a thing holed up in here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nope. Didn't hear a peep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sealing yourself away to work is really...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it, I don't even know where to start.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Medjehtiqedti",
        "end": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_button",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just hear it yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_oldtvelectricity",
        "volume": 0,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "o"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": "o",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Emergencies across multiple districts of Menat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Announcement"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many metallic humanoid constructs have broken into homes and stolen large quantities of gems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Announcement"
    },
    {
        "text": "Residents have reported these robberies to the city guard, and the captain assures us that an investigation is currently underway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Announcement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Metallic humanoid constructs...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "According to an eyewitness, he saw these metallic constructs breaking out from the museum last night...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Announcement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "o",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... Everything I wanted to say, the radio already said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anat says the museum staff followed their tracks and ended up at the Grand Bazaar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this Zubayr's doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We suspect so, but nobody's seen him at all lately. You were in contact with him the longest. Could you help us look for him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it. I'll head over right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you and Anat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're in charge of the museum, we have to find all the artifacts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going to head out and have a look ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I find anything, I'll let you two know. Be seeing you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_oldtvelectricity",
        "volume": 0,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "o"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": "o",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Err, hold on, we interrupt this program for some breaking news.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Announcement"
    },
    {
        "text": "Residents have noticed the water coming out of their taps is muddy and full of silt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Announcement"
    },
    {
        "text": "The city guard reports that they have dispatched emergency teams to inspect the city's old underground water pipes. Due to their complexity, this process will take some time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Announcement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just what is going on here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "o",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
