    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "53_g10_grandbazaar_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$memory_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fsmummy",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone has already told me the tale of this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "The prosperity of the Grand Bazaar is borne upon gems, alongside spices, silks, and crafts, all flowing through the river of commerce to bestow riches upon this land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "The gem trading post and the gems with unusual Originium circuits have transformed Menat-Ha'mait into a morning star on the crown of sand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_bellshake",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_sandstone",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "effect",
        "name": "$e_sandfall_01",
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_sand_lp",
        "volume": 0,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "sa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": "sa",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Several houses begin to turn into sand. People throw open their windows or rush out their doors, staring in disbelief at the ancient buildings they have lived in for generations, and then at Zubayr, who stands in the middle of the street."
    },
    {
        "text": "But Zubayr pays them no heed."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "sa",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He stoops down and picks up a piece of jewelry from the pooling sands, its gem glinting within the metallic helix structure under the sun."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fresco you mentioned is straight ahead, Zubayr Effendi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "My mother's father once told me that the painting depicts the lives of ancient Sargonians and records the birth of Menat-Ha'mait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Even if the river dries, and the city is buried beneath the sands, it will not fade.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...'Will not fade', indeed. Just like every gem that has passed your hand and mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it was neither dried river nor burial by sand that brought calamity to the city of yore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "But a flood that destroyed even the peaks of the grand edifices. What remained of their splendor was eventually buried by the sands, becoming a secret of a thousand years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
