    {
        "text": "Each rise of the sun and fall of the moons is a tiny repeat of the endless cycle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "The brevity of a day and the span of a lifetime...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "The birth of a new city, the fall of an empire, and mountains to dust, are but all similar repetitions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Effendi, if I may. I believe that while the fresco captures only a fleeting moment from centuries past, its value lies in that this moment will be repeated countless times to its beholders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Shah ordered this fresco made not to ensure his name would be remembered throughout history.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "He hoped to leave behind his interpretations of time and life. To serve as a foundation that the people yet to come could imitate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here did the Shah of Past and Future build his trove, and so it was that during the long Aslan Wars, which raged after his death, countless lords ameer coveted this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until the hellish heat waves from the far south brought great change to the climate. A devastating flood ensued, toppling walls, diverting rivers, and leaving the land forever scarred.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "And so the people searched the sands for traces of the trove, but found nothing. Thus did they believe it was washed away in the deluge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "The treasure hunters of the lords ameer left, but the artisans and merchants came, establishing a new settlement by the riverside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have been watchful of all that transpires here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was ordered to guard the trove. That is my duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "I dwelled beneath the sands, fending off miscreants who dared approach for countless moons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you, young one, you should know better than any other: the Shah's treasure trove lies beneath this city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
