    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'Fourth, the liver. We go into the night, awake and alert, for duty and obligation.' ...I thank you for returning this gem to me. It has restored more of my memories.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "The treasure trove started with tens of thousands of skilled craftsmen gathering at the then-desolate Menat-Ha'mait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "From majestic labyrinths made of gold to hand-crafted gems inlaid with Originium circuits, the artificers created them all and buried them beneath the sands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Later generations mostly believed that after exhausting all their energies on their work, these artisans were all buried alongside their creations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in truth, some still lived in a secluded village to the southwest of Menat-Ha'mait, and for many generations, they guarded the secret of the trove's entrance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is now your turn to speak, young one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "What follows next involves the story of your family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The young overseer shuts his eyes tight, as though drowning in the heavy sands of memory."
    },
    {
        "text": "The tale has been passed down from generation to generation, seared into the mind like the scorching sun above the desert."
    },
    {
        "text": "Its heat burning, singeing, and blistering."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Three hundred years ago, an army comprised of the forces of many lords ameer and padishahs found that village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "They interrogated the villagers on the location of the trove's entrance, cutting the hands off of anyone who refused to speak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "A gemwright who had already lost his hands could no longer bear to see more of his kin suffer, so he approached the army and proposed to lead the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the trove, he watched the terrible battle between the army and its guardian unfold. He saw that though the guardian was defeated, the gates would not open without his Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The furious army cut open the guardian's chest, plundering every gem inlaid within and without his body.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Although the gemwright used every technique he knew to guide his young child in restoring the guardian, he never woke up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "After that, a set of scales was set up in the Grand Bazaar of Menat-Ha'mait. Once an adult, the gemwright's child buried the guardian, then established a trading post specializing in gems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "His descendants have been waiting there ever since.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every generation did all they could to ensure Menat-Ha'mait's gem trade would become even more prosperous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether it takes a hundred years or a thousand, the day will come when the people scour the sands of Sargon, and all the gems will gather in this city once more...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "...And I shall return them to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_bellshake",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The overseer dares not open his eyes as he feels Zubayr's sistrum press upon his chest."
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet, visions of centuries passing flash before him in an instant."
    },
    {
        "text": "He witnesses suns rise and moons fall, cities flourish and then crumble, returning to the sands from which they came."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "53_i09_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_ancestor",
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He sees the ancient guardian walking in the boundless desert."
    },
    {
        "text": "The guardian spreads his arms, basking in the light of the stars, facing eastwards to welcome the sunrise."
    },
    {
        "text": "Feeling watched, the guardian looks down and meets the young overseer's eyes."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "53_i09_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Under his merciful gaze, the overseer trembles."
    },
    {
        "text": "He trembles in anticipation of the momentous words the guardian is about to utter."
    },
    {
        "text": "Your family's journey for penitence has been long indeed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are all free now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
