        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fsmummy",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "It has been quite a while, you two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many centuries have I forgotten my duty, but now I return to the mortal realm. I, alongside this city, shall make up for the time we have squandered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at the same time, I have a request, and I hope the two of you will agree to see it through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that Nightzmora truly is the descendent of Kharanduu Khagan, then I will honor the Shah's promise and open the trove for her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Woof, aid me in ascertaining her lineage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_dogbarknormal",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1483_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave it to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woof"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must put her to the test as well. If she is ultimately incapable of completing her Khaganquest, she will never be considered a true Nightzmora.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what may come, make sure she takes that step.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1483_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woof"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I have to go as well? I never thought those Nightzmora were any good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are too many drunks among them, spilling their drinks all over the place. I don't feel like having to lick my fur clean again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Mio. I need you to aid me with another matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out with it, young one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "After I sank into slumber, the Shah's treasure trove suffered heavy damage. A dereliction of my duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must admit that even with the constructs at my side, my strength would not be enough to hold back the combined armies of the lords ameer and the padishahs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just tell me your decision. I'll get it done for you, like I always do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I met a girl. I believe she can help me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Following the footsteps of the Shah, she found one of my lost gems. If not for her, I would not have awakened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_meowlong",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you mean that kid? I've seen her, seemed like a good egg.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Motivated, lively... too bad she's a little too stubborn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reminds me of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed. After searching through my memories, the girl's conduct and demeanor feel rather familiar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She reminds me of my elder sister. When we walked down the streets of the City of Gold, she could tell me the origin of every brick and tile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was especially fascinated by the things of yore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want me to do with the girl, Zubayr?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need a companion. One who will await the Shah's return alongside me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_bellshake",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Help me confirm if she is worthy, Mio.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's your wish, Zubayr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I shall go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
